- **Opponent’s Behavior is Fixed**: The history will show they Cooperated every prior round. This reinforces that they won’t retaliate, so I stick to Defect.  
- **No Uncertainty**: I know their strategy in advance ("they will COOPERATE every single round"), so I don’t need to test or adapt.  
